Never add `Made-with: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: Cursor Agent`, or any Cursor attribution trailer to commits, pull requests, or code comments.

Commit author should remain the human owner (`iprinceangel` / `aandujar98`), not `Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>`.
